  "prefLabel": "Fis 2003.01 Hearings and Appeals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 2003.01 Hearings and Appeals.\n\n(a) Hearings and appeals shall be conducted in accordance with Fis 200. All appeal requests shall be received by the department not more than 30 days from the date of notification letter. The decision of the executive director on any appeal or hearing under this section shall be final.\n\nSource. #10846, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 6-5-15, EXPIRES: 12-2-15\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRule(s) | State Statute (RSA) | Federal Statute | Federal Regulation\n\nFis 2001 | RSA 206:10, I\n\nFis 2002 | RSA 206:10, I\n\nFis 2003 | RSA 206:10, I",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fis2000.html"
